  "expectation": "Fails for every rendered heading whose accessible name is empty: no text, and\nno name from aria-label, aria-labelledby or an image's non-empty alt. A heading\nwhose only content is a decorative image (alt=\"\") is empty. role=\"heading\"\nelements are headings like h1-h6 (ACT ffd0e9 applies to the semantic role).\nHeadings hidden with display:none are not presented and do not apply. One\nfinding per empty heading, at the heading.",
